  "info": "Two simulated devices that talk to the hub over real UDP on this machine, so the hub\npath is exercised exactly as with hardware.\n\n  dummy TV       : publishes /tv/m (motor speed) at 20 Hz, slow sine + noise. Inject buttons freeze it at a value.\n  dummy cassette : listens on :9001 for /cassette/set/m, remembers it, echoes /cassette/m at 20 Hz.\n\nDelete this tab when real devices exist (the real cassette would also use port 9001)."
 },
